## Approach
If we already know the span of previous days, we can skip many comparisons.

Instead of checking every element, we jump spans.

This is what the stack helps us do.



When a new price arrives, we check:

while stack.top.price ≤ current price

If true:

add its span
pop it

Because the current price dominates that price.

